<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5300 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5300 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5300 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.4406 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 20		 June 19</p>
<p> High			     75.5300		 75.5000</p>
<p> Low				75.4402		 75.4200</p>
<p> Open			     75.4869		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.5300		 75.4406</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    0.230		   2.975</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
